# DIRT workspace

Confirm the current checkout and branch before editing. Preserve existing work
and use the checkout assigned to the task; do not switch folders or reset history
because an older document names another path.

General workspace and test guidance is in `AGENTS.md`. Routing workspace ownership
and every routing, fuel, pack, and release instruction are defined only in
`docs/ROUTING-SOURCE-OF-TRUTH.md`.
